### Teste rápido (extensão REST Client do VS Code)
@api = http://localhost:3333/api

# @name login
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "usuario": "admin", "senha": "admin123" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### 1. Validar e calcular sem salvar
POST {{api}}/pos/preview
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "familia": "Sobre-lençol",
  "tamanho": "Solteiro",
  "perimetroM": 6.96,
  "pontosCm": 2.5,
  "maquina": 1,
  "elementos": "2.1, 1.1, 3.1"
}

### 2. Criar PO — código (PO-SL-001) e Rev. 00 são gerados
# @name criada
POST {{api}}/pos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

< ./exemplos/demanda-PO-SL-001.json

###
@poId = {{criada.response.body._id}}

### 3. Histórico
GET {{api}}/pos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Análise da PO
GET {{api}}/pos/{{poId}}/analise
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Exportar Excel
GET {{api}}/pos/{{poId}}/excel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
